(R,"Is there a hashing approach?"),
(S,"Rabin Karp hashes each window and rolls the hash forward by one letter in constant time, verifying only when hashes match. The Z algorithm computes, for every position, how long a match with the start of the string is. For a a b c a a b it gives zero, one, zero, zero, three, one, zero."),
